---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Blog for property owners renting in Mérida
seoTitle: Guides for Rental Property Owners in Mérida
description: Practical guides for owners and investors with houses, apartments or buildings on long-term leases in Mérida, Yucatán, Mexico.
permalink: /en/blog/
lang: en
altUrl: /blog/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
      <section class="post__header">
        <div class="container post__container">
          <div class="tag">Blog</div>
          <h1 class="post__title">Guides for owners renting out property in Mérida</h1>
          <p class="post__lead">
            Rent collection, maintenance, costs and decisions for anyone who already
            owns a house, apartment or building on a long-term lease.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="container post__container blog-list">
        {%- if collections.postsEn.length %}
        <ul class="post-list">
          {%- for p in collections.postsEn %}
          <li class="post-card">
            <a href="{{ p.url }}">
              <span class="post-card__cat">{{ p.data.categoria or "Owner's guide" }}</span>
              <span class="post-card__title">{{ p.data.title }}</span>
              <span class="post-card__desc">{{ p.data.description }}</span>
              <span class="post-card__meta">{{ p.date | fechaLarga("en-US") }}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
        {%- else %}
        <p>Our first guides are coming soon.</p>
        {%- endif %}
        <p class="blog-list__note">
          Looking for a house or apartment to rent or buy? Rendara does not rent out
          or sell properties; please contact our
          <a href="/en/#contacto" class="link-gold">partner real estate agencies</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
